window.products.push({"id":479042,"name":"2023 Graduation Decorations, 3 Pcs Class of 2023 Congrats Grad Banner, Green and Black Graduation Party Decorations Hanging Banner Door Porch Sign Pho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMYOPBk6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2023 Graduation Party Decorations】After all the hard work in high school or college, graduates deserve a celebration worth remembering. Liven up the ceremony and get everyone in the mood to celebrate success of the young grads with the exciting graduation banner of decorations! 【Easy to Use】The congrats grad banner is pre-assembled to save your time to decorate the graduation party or your door. You can hook them to anywhere you like to celebrate the 2023 graduation. There is also a hook design at the bottom, which can be firmly fixed even at outdoors and keep it from blowing in the wind. 【Green and Black Party Decorations】This graduation party supplies includes 3 banners, both \"Class of 2023\" and \"Congrats GRAD\" banners measure approx. 70.8 x 11.8 inches/ 180 x 30 cm, \"Graduation\" banner measures approx. 11.8 x 9.8 inches/ 30 x 25 cm, all of these banners are large enough to let people notice. 【Durable Fabric】The class of 2023 decorations is made of polyester oxford fabric which not easy to wear or fade. And the lightweight and soft fabric made it foldable and portable. 【Multiple Occasions Available】You can hang the graduation banner on the school gate, on the scene of the graduation ceremony, or use them as a decoration for graduation photos or graduation parties. It's also an ideal decor to hook on the balcony, lawn, anywhere outside the door. Brighten up the party even more with the large and colorful banner and let all the people know 'I'm done!'.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PMYOPBk6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hsypti","source_asin":"B09T2S72TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2S72TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2S72TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
