window.products.push({"id":479152,"name":"Mark Lewis Art Print Lady Gaga 8x10 on metal - ea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h2GLBSkZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LADY GAGA ART PRINT Now own a personally signed abstract modern metal art print of celebrity star LADY GAGA by artist Mark Lewis Art . This is a special H/E edition metal art print created from an original painting titled \"EVERYDAY ART\" Lewis' eye catching wall decor metal art prints are ideal for any room in your home. Lewis hails from a long line of decorative pop art artists and uses aluminum as the foundation to ensure a pure and brilliant, 3-D looking image of nothing other than his unique enchanting collections of famous modern and abstract pop art portraits he has created throughout his artistic career. Each simply incredible 8”x 10” HDR image comes with a 3-d wall mount, a certificate of authenticity and a plate on the reverse with the artistic hand signature of Mark Lewis. Your personal order will arrive in a well-padded package for safe shipping. ABOUT MARK LEWIS ART Why should you invest in Mark Lewis art today? Because in addition to its own artistic significance, this piece has fascinating relevance to the cultural and political history of the United States. The artist Mark Lewis is one of only a few surviving relatives (and the last in his lineage) of baseball legend Cy Young, the winning-est pitcher in MLB history. Mark is also the 10th Great Grandson of Richard Carder, who was one of the 23 signers of the first document in American history that severed both political and religious ties with England (the Portsmouth Compact in 1636) and formed a colony that would eventually become Portsmouth, Rhode Island. Due to these unique ancestral ties to such significant members of American history, combined with Mark's own artistic talent for painting and recreating famous photographs of Pop Culture icons, we believe that this piece is a sound investment for collectors of modern and contemporary American art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91h2GLBSkZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mark Lewis Art","source_asin":"B074N9C3GD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074N9C3GD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074N9C3GD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
