window.products.push({"id":479257,"name":"WantJoin 100% Silicone Food Storage Bags 8 Packs of Reusable Food Storage Bags (Upright) Suitable for Storage of Various Foods Freezing, Keeping Fresh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TNMYdd5CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Leak-proof and user-friendly】WantJoin reusable food storage bags are leak-proof and ordor locking with sealing strips included in the package. You don’t need to put the storage bags with liquids inside upright as long as you seal them with the sealing strips, which are convenient for travelling or commuting. Unlike other zippers, their zippers don’t overlap in the corners, making them easy to pour liquids out. 【Multiple Uses】Thanks to its excellent sealing effect, WantJoin reusable silicone bags can keep food fresh to store and marinade, keeping your food’s nutrients, flavors and juices locked in. They’re ideal for sandwiches, snacks, lunch, vegetables, fruit, food prep, cooking, lunches and left overs,etc. 【Functional&Convenient】WantJoin resealable lunch bags set are resistant to extra-low and super-high temperature of -40℃ to 230℃(-40℉ to 446℉).Thus they are safe to use in a freezer, a microwave, an oven and boiling water,etc. As ideal replacement of plates and dishes, they are space-saving and keep your refrigerator neat and organized. 【Durable food-grade silicone】WantJoin silicone bags for food storage are made of soft and stretchy food-grade silicone, which withstands long-term use and tearing. They doesn’t accumulate scale deposit in water. They’re easy to clean by hand or in a dishwasher. 【Notes】A package includes 3*dishes, 3*cups, 2*bags and 8 sealing strips. Totally 3 shapes and 8 sizes meet different needs. To remove silicone smell you can boil the silicone food storage bags and containers with tea leaves. The white storage bags may appear a bit yellow due to long-time storing, which is normal and doesn’t influence use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TNMYdd5CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WantJoin","source_asin":"B09Y2RTK1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y2RTK1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y2RTK1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
