window.products.push({"id":479272,"name":"AKS Vacuum Insulated Double Wall Stainless Steel Water Bottle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mcbJKRkGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Introduction: Inspired by the untrammeled jellyfish, AKS designers shape these bottles in golden ratio line, which makes them comfortable to hold or carry. AKS vacuum insulation technology for maximum temperature retention hot or cold in that it creates an airless space between two walls, hardly eliminating temperature change, therefore, your drink stays steamy hot or icy cold whatever the forecast is. Moreover, AKS vacuum bottles are durable because they are stainless steel interior and exterior which can withstand the demands of daily use. Furthermore, candy color and cute appearance of AKS bottle is going to add much fun to your life. Product description : 1. Highest Quality, BPA Free, Stainless Steel Design AKS uses the best quality 18/8 stainless steel on both the interior and exterior walls, therefore, you can be 100% sure you and your family are drinking the cleanest, safest drinks possible. 2. Keep Your Drinks Extra Cold for 24 Hours or Piping Hot for 12 Hours AKS bottles are made from double-walled 18/8 stainless steel with vacuum insulation so that your drinks will stay cold up to 24 hours or warm for 12 hours. Ideal for outdoors whether, hiking, biking, playing tennis, golfing, at work, at home or on the go 3. Premium “No Sweat” Coating Bottles feature a No Sweat Design to keep your hands dry with double-wall vacuum insulation to lock in temperatures 4. Easy to Clean AKS bottles are made by nonstick coated washable materials so that they are easy-to-clean. You can hand wash with soap and water and simply use a bottle brush which helps to clean the very bottom of the AKS tank. 5.High-capacity This 17 Oz bottle is perfectly sized to keep you hydrated all day long, from your morning commute, to meetings, to yoga class to work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mcbJKRkGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AKS","source_asin":"B072M993PP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072M993PP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072M993PP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
