window.products.push({"id":479386,"name":"Foxglover Wedding Guest Book - PU Leather Classy Design Gold Embossed Guest Book with 60 Lined Pages - Create Lasting Memories for Special Occasions L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q8hnRgG3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Guests can sign their names and leave memorable messages that you can look back on during your anniversary. Let your guests and family members write inspiring messages that your child can look back upon them in future, it will be a gift that is cherished for years to come. Gold Embossed Guestbook: This is a PU leather beige colored, gold embossed wedding guestbook that can be used for other special occasions including anniversary parties, baptisms, funerals, etc. Just got a whole lot easier as you have gifted her one of the very few physical keepsakes of her big day. Classic Design Book: Plan your wedding in style. The wedding book planner comes in a gorgeous classic design with a lovely, elegant cover, gold embossed. Sure to become a cherished keepsake that you’ll love to browse through in later years. Specifications: ● Size: 9x8 Inches● Paper Weight: 100g Paper● Number of Pages: 60 Lined Pages (30 Sheets Total) Everything in One Place: A great way to have everything in one place and for staying on track with appointments, fittings and more. Thanks to the handy format you can easily take the wedding planner to meetings for floral arrangements, wedding and more. Truly a guestbook that is perfect for keeping sweet memories and keepsakes. Strong & Durable Book: It's not just a great-looking guest book. It's also heavy duty and meant to last long. The binding is strong and paper is heavyweight, durable stock paper capable of handling long-term use. Go back and read the notes hundreds of times. We set out with a simple goal to create the most beautiful occasion. Plan of your Dreams: The adorable occasion planner book and organizer for the bride and groom is the perfect companion for planning the ultimate wedding. Covering all the topics you have thought of and perhaps not have thought of yet, leads you into your wedding day seamlessly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q8hnRgG3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foxglover","source_asin":"B09JMKSVXZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JMKSVXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JMKSVXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
