window.products.push({"id":479824,"name":"Rock Your Chakra Orthoceras Fossil 5 1/2\" Morocco Rocks Minerals Root Chakra Healing Crystals and Stones","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814C+PZuPBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Extra large polished orthoceras fossil specimens imported from Morocco. You will receive one specimen from the lot shown in the photos that is 5 inch to 6 inch long. Healing Properties Fossils are a wonderful tool to assist you in moving from the old to the new and to be receptive to the fresh, innovative forces that are available to you. Fossils can assist you in your quest for transition, transformation and personal growth, helping you to understand the process of change. They can help you instil quality and excellence in your environment. The trilobite can promote both leadership and management skills, allowing one to rule lovingly and with patience and fortitude. It assists in the development of patience, strength, and perseverance, allowing one to recognize the desired course and to maintain the pathway which will produce the desired goal. It is an example for humanity that one may be in charge of the world, and still, virtually, be required to \"sit in the mud\". Mineral Description Orthoceras (straight horn) is a genus of extinct nautiloid cephalopod. This genus is sometimes called Orthoceratites. Note it is sometimes misspelled as Orthocera, Orthocerus or Orthoceros. These are slender, elongate shells with the middle of the body chamber transversely constricted, and a subcentral orthochoanitic siphuncle. The surface is ornamented by a network of fine lirae.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814C+PZuPBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rock Your Chakra","source_asin":"B082ZRPRXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082ZRPRXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082ZRPRXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":479825,"name":"Bruntmor 13 Inch Non Stick cast iron Grill Pan, Induction Stove top grill plate, grilled pan for Sovetop, Outdoor Gridle Pan for Steak, and Meats.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MGPbLMhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bruntmor 13 inch cast iron grill pan works with electric, gas, and induction cooktops and ovens. It’s great for veggies on an outdoor grill or frying the perfect steak. Our grill pans offer restaurant quality searing and come preseason for an easy release cooking surface when used with a thin layer of oil. Bruntmor Cast iron can rust so keep it out of the dishwasher, do not soak overnight, or air dry. Use warm water and scrape off any stuck food with a flat utensil. You can also lightly polish the cooking surface with a stainless steel chainmail scrubber for a smooth patina. Wipe dry immediately after cleaning, and apply a new layer of oil to protect from rust. Bruntmor 13 inch square grill pan comes with a smoother finish than other cast iron brands and is a perfect match for any oven or stove top. Use it for indoor or outdoor grilling, as a panini press, and even outside over a fire like vintage Griswold and Wagner pans we Gift Idea : For the chef who swears by cast iron; for the home cook who’s discovered its allure; for the sourdough baker; for the guy with a penchant for cooking; for the granny who appreciates the high-quality of yesteryear. Give ‘em the gift of a Legend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MGPbLMhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bruntmor","source_asin":"B0BKLGZHPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-479825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKLGZHPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKLGZHPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
